{"product_id":"navigator-smartwatch","title":"Navigator Smartwatch","description":"\u003ch3 data-start=\"290\" data-end=\"351\"\u003eNavigator Smartwatch – Precision GPS. Rugged Performance.\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"353\" data-end=\"704\"\u003eThe \u003cstrong data-start=\"357\" data-end=\"381\"\u003eNavigator \u003c\/strong\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/zerolifestyle.co\/pages\/smart-watches\"\u003eSmart watch\u003c\/a\u003e is built for people who take accuracy seriously — from outdoor explorers to everyday athletes. With \u003cstrong data-start=\"482\" data-end=\"504\"\u003ehigh-precision GPS\u003c\/strong\u003e, advanced health sensors, and a \u003cstrong data-start=\"537\" data-end=\"563\"\u003eworking rotating crown\u003c\/strong\u003e for ultra-smooth control, Navigator gives you powerful performance in a tough, outdoor-ready design.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"353\" data-end=\"704\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"relative inline-flex items-center\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003eSpec - Navigator\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003chr data-start=\"706\" data-end=\"709\"\u003e\n\u003ch4 data-start=\"711\" data-end=\"748\"\u003e🔭 High-Precision GPS Tracking\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"749\" data-end=\"889\"\u003eGo further with confidence. Navigator’s \u003cstrong data-start=\"789\" data-end=\"827\"\u003eintegrated high-precision GPS chip\u003c\/strong\u003e tracks your route, pace, and distance with accuracy across:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"890\" data-end=\"976\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"890\" data-end=\"901\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"892\" data-end=\"901\"\u003eWalking\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"902\" data-end=\"913\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"904\" data-end=\"913\"\u003eRunning\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"914\" data-end=\"925\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"916\" data-end=\"925\"\u003eCycling\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"926\" data-end=\"943\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"928\" data-end=\"943\"\u003eTrail running\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"944\" data-end=\"976\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"946\" data-end=\"976\"\u003eHiking \/ on-foot exploration\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"978\" data-end=\"1016\"\u003eNo phone needed for location tracking.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003chr data-start=\"1018\" data-end=\"1021\"\u003e\n\u003ch4 data-start=\"1023\" data-end=\"1070\"\u003e🎛 Working Rotating Crown + Sport Button\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1071\" data-end=\"1104\"\u003eNavigate your watch like a pro:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"1105\" data-end=\"1307\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1105\" data-end=\"1175\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1107\" data-end=\"1175\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1107\" data-end=\"1125\"\u003eRotating crown\u003c\/strong\u003e to scroll menus, switch tiles, and zoom quickly\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1176\" data-end=\"1247\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1178\" data-end=\"1247\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1178\" data-end=\"1209\"\u003eDedicated Sport Mode button\u003c\/strong\u003e for one-tap access to your workouts\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1248\" data-end=\"1307\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1250\" data-end=\"1307\"\u003eExtra \u003cstrong data-start=\"1256\" data-end=\"1271\"\u003eHome button\u003c\/strong\u003e for fast control in any situation\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1309\" data-end=\"1400\"\u003eEven with gloves or sweaty hands, the physical controls keep everything under your command.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003chr data-start=\"1402\" data-end=\"1405\"\u003e\n\u003ch4 data-start=\"1407\" data-end=\"1454\"\u003e🌈 290+ Watch Faces \u0026amp; Full Customisation\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1455\" data-end=\"1477\"\u003eMake it truly yours:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"1478\" data-end=\"1646\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1478\" data-end=\"1520\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1480\" data-end=\"1520\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1480\" data-end=\"1518\"\u003e5 default watch faces on the watch\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1521\" data-end=\"1582\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1523\" data-end=\"1582\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1523\" data-end=\"1559\"\u003eOver 290+ additional watch faces\u003c\/strong\u003e available in the app\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1583\" data-end=\"1646\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1585\" data-end=\"1646\"\u003eDIY custom dials using your own photos, colours, and styles\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1648\" data-end=\"1702\"\u003eYou can switch looks from sporty to formal in seconds.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003chr data-start=\"1704\" data-end=\"1707\"\u003e\n\u003ch4 data-start=\"1709\" data-end=\"1755\"\u003e⚡ Magnetic Charging \u0026amp; Long Battery Life\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1756\" data-end=\"1820\"\u003eCharging is effortless with the \u003cstrong data-start=\"1788\" data-end=\"1817\"\u003eincluded magnetic charger\u003c\/strong\u003e:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"1821\" data-end=\"2019\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1821\" data-end=\"1882\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1823\" data-end=\"1882\"\u003eSimply snap the charger to the back – no ports, no hassle\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1883\" data-end=\"1944\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1885\" data-end=\"1944\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1885\" data-end=\"1903\"\u003e300mAh battery\u003c\/strong\u003e with up to \u003cstrong data-start=\"1915\" data-end=\"1942\"\u003e3–5 days of typical use\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1945\" data-end=\"1980\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1947\" data-end=\"1980\"\u003eUp to \u003cstrong data-start=\"1953\" data-end=\"1978\"\u003e10–12 days on standby\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1981\" data-end=\"2019\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1983\" data-end=\"2019\"\u003eFull charge in about \u003cstrong data-start=\"2004\" data-end=\"2019\"\u003e2.5–3 hours\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003chr data-start=\"2021\" data-end=\"2024\"\u003e\n\u003ch4 data-start=\"2026\" data-end=\"2070\"\u003e🧠 Advanced Health \u0026amp; Fitness Tracking\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2071\" data-end=\"2123\"\u003eStay on top of your health with precision sensors:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"2124\" data-end=\"2378\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2124\" data-end=\"2154\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2126\" data-end=\"2154\"\u003e24\/7 heart rate monitoring\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2155\" data-end=\"2187\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2157\" data-end=\"2187\"\u003eBlood oxygen (SpO2) tracking\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2188\" data-end=\"2226\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2190\" data-end=\"2226\"\u003eBlood pressure \u0026amp; stress monitoring\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2227\" data-end=\"2259\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2229\" data-end=\"2259\"\u003eSleep tracking with insights\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2260\" data-end=\"2307\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2262\" data-end=\"2307\"\u003eBreath training modes (Relax \/ Fall asleep)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2308\" data-end=\"2378\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2310\" data-end=\"2378\"\u003e100+ sports modes with detailed metrics (steps, kcal, duration, MET)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003chr data-start=\"2380\" data-end=\"2383\"\u003e\n\u003ch4 data-start=\"2385\" data-end=\"2427\"\u003e🖥 1.43\" AMOLED Display + Always-On\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2428\" data-end=\"2502\"\u003eEnjoy a vivid, sharp view with a \u003cstrong data-start=\"2461\" data-end=\"2499\"\u003e1.43-inch AMOLED display (466×466)\u003c\/strong\u003e:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"2503\" data-end=\"2603\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2503\" data-end=\"2535\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2505\" data-end=\"2535\"\u003eAlways-On Display clock mode\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2536\" data-end=\"2558\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2538\" data-end=\"2558\"\u003eFull touch control\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2559\" data-end=\"2603\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2561\" data-end=\"2603\"\u003eCrisp, bright visuals indoors and outdoors\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003chr data-start=\"2605\" data-end=\"2608\"\u003e\n\u003ch4 data-start=\"2610\" data-end=\"2658\"\u003e📞 Smart Features That Keep You Connected\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"2659\" data-end=\"2988\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2659\" data-end=\"2714\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2661\" data-end=\"2714\"\u003eBluetooth calling (dial\/answer\/reject on the watch)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2715\" data-end=\"2768\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2717\" data-end=\"2768\"\u003eApp notifications (social apps, SMS, calls, etc.)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2769\" data-end=\"2791\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2771\" data-end=\"2791\"\u003eAI voice assistant\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2792\" data-end=\"2843\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2794\" data-end=\"2843\"\u003eWeather, alarms, timers, stopwatch, world clock\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2844\" data-end=\"2906\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2846\" data-end=\"2906\"\u003eSedentary \/ drink water reminders, goal achievement alerts\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2907\" data-end=\"2948\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2909\" data-end=\"2948\"\u003eRemote camera shutter \u0026amp; music control\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2949\" data-end=\"2988\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2951\" data-end=\"2988\"\u003eFind my phone, DND \u0026amp; low power mode\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003chr data-start=\"2990\" data-end=\"2993\"\u003e\n\u003ch4 data-start=\"2995\" data-end=\"3016\"\u003e💧 Built Tough\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"3017\" data-end=\"3175\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"3017\" data-end=\"3086\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"3019\" data-end=\"3086\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"3019\" data-end=\"3038\"\u003eIP68 waterproof\u003c\/strong\u003e – ready for sweat, splashes, and everyday use\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"3087\" data-end=\"3137\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"3089\" data-end=\"3137\"\u003eAluminum alloy + ABS frame, PC base, TPU strap\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"3138\" data-end=\"3175\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"3140\" data-end=\"3175\"\u003eComfortable 60.5g wearable weight\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Black Red","offer_id":50750584226070,"sku":"23043","price":12999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Green","offer_id":50750584291606,"sku":"23046","price":12999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Camou Gray","offer_id":50750584258838,"sku":"23047","price":12999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Orange","offer_id":50750584324374,"sku":"23044","price":12999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Beige","offer_id":50750584160534,"sku":"23048","price":12999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Black","offer_id":50750584193302,"sku":"23045","price":14999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/1_d8b06a71-8b9c-456